| \x1b[1mHelp\x1b[m - Preflight                                                                                                     |
|                                                                                                                      |
| up/down     check                                                                                                    |
| Tab         action                                                                                                   |
| Enter       select                                                                                                   |
| Esc         back                                                                                                     |
| q           exit                                                                                                     |
| ?/F1        help                                                                                                     |
| Ctrl+C      exit                                                                                                     |
|                                                                                                                      |
| The checks are read-only: they never install software or change Docker, the kernel or a cluster. A fix is advice, or |
| a change to the pending plan that runs the checks again; Recheck runs them again as they are. Continue is            |
| unavailable while any check fails. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on these screens changes anything until you |
| approve the plan on the review. Ctrl+C exits.                                                                        |
